{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage an interstellar spy business in this turn-based strategy game with 90-minute runs. Explore a randomly generated universe, expand your espionage network, exploit weaknesses in corporate information security, and exterminate companies by strategic sale of their information to the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/ProbeAndPlaceHubsVer2.gif?t=1749626057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a randomly generated universe with your trusted probe. Find planets, asteroids and space stations. Expand your empire by building relays, operations hubs and admin centers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/MultipleOpsDrawingSmall.gif?t=1749626057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch operations from your hubs, target planets and their corporations to steal their data. Target corporations with multiple agents to maximize your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/SellingDataSmall.gif?t=1749626057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell the stolen data to the highest bidder - or keep the data to yourself to keep a corporation from gaining too much influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/DataSellingEffects.png?t=1749626057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See your data go to good use as you change the corporate landscape by strategic sale of information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make enough money to earn your retirement on a private planet - or end up failing and bumming it on a cheap asteroid with your space dog.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563480?t=1749626057","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563480?t=1749626057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/798d40101bb6b7c510deea0a3d254c923d23240e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749626057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/798d40101bb6b7c510deea0a3d254c923d23240e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749626057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage an interstellar spy business in this turn-based strategy game with 90-minute runs. Explore a randomly generated universe, expand your espionage network, exploit weaknesses in corporate information security, and exterminate companies by strategic sale of their information to the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/ProbeAndPlaceHubsVer2.gif?t=1749626057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a randomly generated universe with your trusted probe. Find planets, asteroids and space stations. Expand your empire by building relays, operations hubs and admin centers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/MultipleOpsDrawingSmall.gif?t=1749626057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch operations from your hubs, target planets and their corporations to steal their data. Target corporations with multiple agents to maximize your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akama